#: models.py:23
msgid "Display Name:"
msgstr "Vertoonnaam:"

#: models.py:26
msgid "This name appears in the horizontal navigation at the top of the page."
msgstr "Hierdie naam verskyn in die horisontale navigasie boaan die bladsy."

#: models.py:29
msgid "Link Text:"
msgstr "Skakelteks:"

#: models.py:32
msgid "This is the text that will link to your survey."
msgstr "Dit is die teks wat na jou opname sal skakel."

#: models.py:35
msgid "Message:"
msgstr "Boodskap:"

#: models.py:38
msgid "This is the text that will be displayed above the link to your survey."
msgstr "Dit is die teks wat bo die skakel na jou opname vertoon sal word."

#: models.py:41
msgid "Extra Parameters:"
msgstr "Ekstra Parameters:"

#: models.py:45
msgid ""
"Additional query parameters to include in the survey URL. Format: "
"key1=value1&key2=value2. If blank, no extra parameters are added."
msgstr ""
"Bykomende navraagparameters om in die opname-URL in te sluit. Formaat: "
"sleutel1=waarde1&sleutel2=waarde2. Indien leeg, word geen ekstra parameters "
"bygevoeg nie."

#: models.py:51
msgid "Survey ID:"
msgstr "Opname ID:"

#: models.py:55
msgid ""
"This is the ID that Qualtrics uses for the survey, which can include numbers"
" and letters, and should be entered in the following format: "
"SV_###############"
msgstr ""
"Dit is die ID wat Qualtrics vir die opname gebruik, wat syfers en letters "
"kan insluit en moet in die volgende formaat ingevoer word: SV_##############"

#: models.py:61
msgid "Your University:"
msgstr "Jou Universiteit:"

#: models.py:65
msgid ""
"The subdomain for your university's Qualtrics account "
"(e.g.'stanforduniversity'). If left blank, the system-wide default is used."
msgstr ""
"Die subdomein vir jou universiteit se Qualtrics-rekening (bv. "
"'stanforduniversity'). Indien dit leeg gelaat word, word die stelselwye "
"verstek gebruik."
